{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"wudi-e-o004a","title":"曹操讨颍川黄巾","accounts":[{"id":"wudi-e-o004a-account","label":"正文","text":"光和末黄巾起，曹操受拜骑都尉，讨颍川黄巾。","evidence":["wudi-e-o004a-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"领兵讨伐","evidence":["wudi-e-o004a-q"]}],"place":{"text":"颍川","evidence":["wudi-e-o004a-q"]},"time":{"label":"光和末","year":184,"precision":"year","basis":"纪年经本批逐段审定；年份依据见所引原文纪年与现代注释。","evidence":["wudi-e-o004a-q","wudi-q-o004","wudi-q-b-0b46b06245df0636b76c"],"chronology":"wudi-y184","dating_review":{"anchor":"wudi-q-o004","basis":"光和末","reviewed":true}},"source_order":[1,40,"O004a"],"order":27}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-e-o004a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f4a52cf5e3cf71b97de6","layer":"original","quote":"光和末〖1〗，黄巾起〖2〗；拜骑都尉〖3〗，讨颍川贼〖4〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":30,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-0b46b06245df0636b76c","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-0b46b06245df0636b76c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗光和：东汉灵帝的年号。光和末是公元 184 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":42,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-457d2e030e6e5be8f05a","start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o004","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-f4a52cf5e3cf71b97de6","layer":"original","quote":"光和末〖1〗，黄巾起〖2〗；拜骑都尉〖3〗，讨颍川贼〖4〗。迁为济南相〖5〗，国有十余县，长吏多阿附贵戚〖6〗，赃污狼藉；于是奏免其八〔九〕。禁断淫祀〖7〗，奸宄逃窜〖8〗，郡界肃然。﹝一﹞久之，征还为东郡太守〖9〗；不就，称疾归乡里。﹝二﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":39,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6